// Config for the two Fly demo apps, baked into the image at
// /etc/docket.kdl (fly.toml points DOCKET_CONFIG at it). Binds wide
// because Fly's edge routes to the machine, not to localhost. `dev` is
// the whole of what makes them demos: fixture data instead of JMAP, and
// a stand-in identity in place of the identity headers that Caddy
// (caddy-tailscale) supplies in front of the real deployment. The database
// sits on the machine's own disk, which a deploy replaces, so each deploy
// starts from the fixtures again.
bind "0.0.0.0:3000"
database "/tmp/docket.db"
dev
